# Sync server URL, baked into the app build so users never type it. This is the
# web app's own API, so it's your Vercel domain with /api on the end — e.g.
# https://your-app.vercel.app/api. More → Account then just needs an email
# + password.
#
# The app works fully offline if this is unset (sign-in is then unavailable, and
# if left blank the Account screen falls back to asking for the URL).
#
# Accounts + the AI coach are configured server-side on Vercel (DATABASE_URL,
# JWT_SECRET, GEMINI_API_KEY); no secrets belong in this file — see
# apps/web/README.md.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SYNC_URL=
